{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/65652baab54f93639eed61fde3e9f14cbc67ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-6x+13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" /> can never be less than:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/1/071b52b1649dc68d6b5689a74b70b1732b15d0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4.5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"372\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> value at which the minimum value of this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic\">quadratic</a> (of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />) occurs is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/025fd4b1b9eb6ea8e905bf90af68fad9fad4e397.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-b}{2a}=-\\frac{-6}{2\\cdot1}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"135\" height=\"39\" />. The minimum value of the quadratic is therefore at\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ff27c421764f126f034363088cf568d69bc6d78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3^2-6\\cdot3+13\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dccb049bcda1242f3df7eb666f123484a24e14e8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=9-18+13\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/4/4e4172bd7555609ecc3880f662062bc1edd65993.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=4.\\]\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" />\nSo, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/239e7ab4bbc25261278465d24ee3447ff04f447c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} \\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<b